{"updated_at": {"date": {"d": "19", "m": "08", "Y": "2026"}, "time": {"H": "08", "M": "21", "S": "50"}}, "news": [{"title": "Ahmedabad civic body suspends development permission of Bodakdev high-rise over TOZ eligibility", "para": "The Ahmedabad Municipal Corporation has suspended the development approval for a high-rise due to doubts about its compliance with Transit Oriented Zone regulations. Initially sanctioned with an excessive Floor Space Index, the project is now under scrutiny. Officials are insisting on a complete re-assessment of its TOZ eligibility, leading to ongoing suspension of development activities until verification is complete.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/regulatory/ahmedabad-civic-body-suspends-development-permission-of-bodakdev-high-rise-over-toz-eligibility/133337337?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-334110/133337337.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "regulatory"}, {"title": "Nagpur civic body to freeze bank accounts, seize TVs & fridge of property tax defaulters", "para": "The Nagpur Municipal Corporation is gearing up for an assertive property tax collection initiative. To recover outstanding dues, the civic body plans to freeze bank accounts and seize properties of those who default on payments. This crucial recovery operation will focus on collecting substantial arrears from local businesses, with teams deployed throughout the city. Citizens are advised to address their tax obligations promptly to evade penalties.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/regulatory/nagpur-civic-body-to-freeze-bank-accounts-seize-tvs-fridge-of-property-tax-defaulters/133337292?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-213330/133337292.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "regulatory"}, {"title": "Pay house tax in three instalments, Prayagraj civic body offers full interest waiver", "para": "Prayagraj Municipal Corporation has launched a one-time settlement scheme for house tax dues. This initiative offers a complete waiver on accumulated interest for property owners. Eligible individuals can pay their principal house tax in up to three installments. The scheme aims to encourage settlement of long-pending property tax liabilities. Property owners can apply through zonal offices or the municipal corporation website.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/residential/pay-house-tax-in-three-instalments-prayagraj-civic-body-offers-full-interest-waiver/133337251?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-165102/133337251.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "residential"}]}